"""CH02EP16 (ROKS Cheonan) clips 13-112: authored Omni chain plan (continues the 2-min sample, clips 1-12).

    py -3.12 build_CH02EP16_013-112.py      -> CH02EP16_omni_plan_013-112.json + rendered prompts

Scene SETS carry the environment, cast (exact counts), lighting, rigid rules and negatives; each CLIP picks a
set, a camera plan and timestamped beats. A clip with "chg" changes scene at that second through a camera
bridge (the first beat after "chg" must describe the bridge); the builder then writes the environment as
"old -- then -- new" and the cast as "old (until t); then new". One change per clip max, never in the last 3 s.
Beat times follow the sentence starts in CH02EP16_omni_GATE2A.md (estimate after 146 s; the assembler retimes).
"""
